      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，對了，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要不要和我打個寶可夢對戰？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
