      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，剛才我派上場的寶可夢\n全都是在屋頂上捉到的喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C525B624D62116D3E4E0A583476845BF653EF5922000A516890FD662F57285C4B98024E0A6349523076845594300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且當然是在我工作的時候！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但是我太著迷了，\n所以一回神就是休息時間啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1475767136662F572862115DE54F5C768466425019FF0100100001BE01000A4F46662F6211592A84578FF74E86FF0C000A62404EE54E0056DE795E5C31662F4F11606F664295935566300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之，在屋頂上能夠\n發現各式各樣的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也找找看吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
